    "text": "The correct order of ionic size of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>Na</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>Mg</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;is :&nbsp;",
